cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PHASE in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "PHASE: Physics-based Hierarchical Adaptive Spatial Evasion"
abstract: >-
  PHASE is a hierarchical multi-agent trajectory coordination algorithm for
  autonomous vehicles sharing a 2D or 3D environment. It combines localized A*
  replanning, event-triggered conflict resolution, priority-weighted lateral
  evasion and iterative geometric constraint correction, so that conflicts are
  resolved locally instead of re-solving the global plan for every change.
authors:
